msgctxt "a_seedphrase_lets_you_recover_your_account"
msgid "A seedphrase lets you recover your account if you lose access."
msgstr "Fraza seed pozwala odzyskać konto, jeśli stracisz do niego dostęp."

msgctxt "a_seedphrase_lets_you_recover_your_account_2"
msgid "A seedphrase lets you recover your account if you lose access. Store it safely."
msgstr "Fraza seed pozwala odzyskać konto, jeśli stracisz do niego dostęp. Przechowuj ją w bezpiecznym miejscu."

#. Settings: heading of the about section.
msgctxt "about"
msgid "About"
msgstr "Informacje"

#. Instructions for accessing the authentication code.
#. Use the {link}...{/link} markers to wrap the "ur.io" portion, which should be rendered as a clickable link.
#. Example usage:
#.   - Web: Replace {link} with <a href="https://ur.io" target="_blank"> and {/link} with </a>
#.   - SwiftUI: Use AttributedString parsing to detect {link}...{/link} and apply .link attribute to the range
#.   - Jetpack Compose: Use AnnotatedString with an annotation for the {link}...{/link} range, and handle clicks accordingly
#. 
msgctxt "access_auth_code_instructions"
msgid "To Access your Auth Code, create an account and sign in to {link}ur.io{/link}. Head over to Account -> Settings -> Create/Copy Auth code -> Paste -> UR In!"
msgstr "Aby uzyskać dostęp do swojego kodu uwierzytelniającego, utwórz konto i zaloguj się na {link}ur.io{/link}. Przejdź do Konto -> Ustawienia -> Utwórz/Skopiuj kod uwierzytelniający -> Wklej -> Gotowe!"

#. Account Screen
msgctxt "account"
msgid "Account"
msgstr "Konto"

#. The account's email or phone, marked as not yet verified. The argument is the email or phone number.
msgctxt "account_auth_unverified"
msgid "{} (unverified)"
msgstr "{} (niezweryfikowano)"

#. The account's email or phone, marked as verified. The argument is the email or phone number.
msgctxt "account_auth_verified"
msgid "{} (verified)"
msgstr "{} (zweryfikowano)"

#. Shown when a purchase is refused before contacting the store because the account is not ready: on apple the networkId is missing or unparseable (Shared/ViewModels/AppStoreSubscriptionManager.swift), on android the active network space has no api yet (the Stripe sheet and pay page purchasers). The purchase could never be credited to anyone. This used to be a silent no-op.
msgctxt "account_isn_t_ready_for_purchases"
msgid "Your account isn't ready for purchases. Please restart the app and try again."
msgstr "Twoje konto nie jest jeszcze gotowe do zakupów. Uruchom ponownie aplikację i spróbuj jeszcze raz."

#. Accessibility label of the row of rings, one per extender carrying a live connection.
