#. The subnet alpha token symbol.
msgctxt "sn_alpha_symbol"
msgid "SN25α"
msgstr "SN25α"

#. Earnings card: how providers are paid on the UR subnet (WHITEPAPER §5.2, §8.3). Earnings settle per epoch and are paid in SN25α as stake to the provider's Bittensor coldkey once the provider claims them; nothing is paid automatically. Followed by sn_payout_schedule_times when the epoch schedule is known.
msgctxt "sn_payout_schedule"
msgid "Earnings settle every epoch and are paid in SN25α to your Bittensor coldkey when you claim them."
msgstr "Zarobki są rozliczane w każdej epoce i wypłacane w SN25α na Twój coldkey Bittensor, gdy je odbierzesz."

#. Earnings card, after sn_payout_schedule: when the current epoch ends, when its share can be claimed and when an unclaimed share expires. The three values are local date-times the app fills from the chain's epoch schedule (the coordinator's policy: the claim-open offset and the claim TTL), never fixed durations.
msgctxt "sn_payout_schedule_times"
msgid "This epoch ends {0}. Claim your share from {1} until {2}."
msgstr "Ta epoka kończy się {0}. Odbierz swój udział od {1} do {2}."

#. Claim status of an epoch whose alpha can be claimed now.
msgctxt "sn_status_claimable"
msgid "Claimable"
msgstr "Do odebrania"

#. Claim status of an epoch the vault has not finalized yet.
msgctxt "sn_status_not_finalized"
msgid "Not finalized"
msgstr "Niesfinalizowana"

#. Claim status of an epoch that is still open (not yet finalized on chain).
msgctxt "sn_status_open"
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Otwarta"

#. Blockchain name. A product name: never translated.
msgctxt "solana"
